{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Pontryagin类"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Pontryagin 类”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>实向量丛的复化给出了包含映射\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{B}O(n)\\to \\mathrm{B}U(n),\r\n$$\nPontryagin 类 $p_k\\in H^{4k}(\\mathrm{B}O(n))$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"陈类","text":"陈类"}},{"Plain":" $c_{2k}$ 的拉回乘以 $(-1)^k$.</p>\n"}]}}